      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure safety, assign dedicated staff members solely to directing kitchen prep for allergy-free and vegan dishes, and provide a written checklist with guests' specific needs directly to the head chef. Clearly mark every food station and serving tray with color-coded labels indicating peanut-free, vegan, or mixed status to prevent cross-contamination at the buffet. Additionally, distribute a concise allergen guide card for every table listing nearby food items to help guests make informed choices.",
